  4. single historical ordering for maxDD/streaks; bootstrap above covers annual variance only.
  5. leverage (commodities 1:10-1:20) not enforced — at 1% on 5K lots are tiny, non-binding.
  6. assumes the prop pays out monthly in full + no consistency-rule block (true for no-daily firms).
